WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:03.906
Polly is looking for Jack.

2
00:00:03.907 --> 00:00:07.008
Will she find him?

3
00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:12.467
Polly: Where did Jack

4
00:00:12.468 --> 00:00:15.110
go? Oh! It's that frog again!

5
00:00:15.111 --> 00:00:17.670
Jack: It's me, Jack!

6
00:00:17.671 --> 00:00:20.594
Polly: What?

7
00:00:20.595 --> 00:00:23.083
Fairy: I put a spell on

8
00:00:23.084 --> 00:00:26.441
him. He ate my beautiful feast!

9
00:00:26.442 --> 00:00:30.285
Now I'll turn you into a frog!

10
00:00:30.286 --> 00:00:53.235
Polly: No, you won't!

11
00:00:53.236 --> 00:01:02.912
Help! An evil fairy! Frog:

12
00:01:02.913 --> 00:01:05.227
That fairy put a spell on me. Then

13
00:01:05.228 --> 00:01:08.806
she stole my castle! Polly:

14
00:01:08.807 --> 00:01:11.805
She put a spell on Jack too! Frog:

15
00:01:11.806 --> 00:01:13.624
You can break her spells.

16
00:01:13.625 --> 00:01:16.267
But listen carefully this time. Polly:

17
00:01:16.268 --> 00:01:19.885
Okay. What should I do? Frog:

18
00:01:19.886 --> 00:01:21.712
Pet my head. Polly:

19
00:01:21.713 --> 00:01:23.553
What? Frog:

20
00:01:23.554 --> 00:01:43.094
Just do it.

21
00:01:43.095 --> 00:01:50.256
Polly: You're a prince!

22
00:01:50.257 --> 00:02:19.179
Come on. Let's save Jack! Jack:

23
00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:30.044
I'm a rabbit again!

24
00:02:30.045 --> 00:02:45.613
Fairy: Grr! You broke my spells!

25
00:02:45.614 --> 00:02:50.532
Polly: Thanks, Prince!

26
00:02:50.533 --> 00:03:05.316
Prince: Don't forget your ball!

27
00:03:05.317 --> 00:03:08.456
Jack: We're back in the

28
00:03:08.457 --> 00:03:12.168
barn. The job is done!

29
00:03:12.169 --> 00:03:15.886
Omar: You can go play ball now.

30
00:03:15.887 --> 00:03:17.854
Polly: No more ball playing

31
00:03:17.855 --> 00:03:29.280
today. I need to say sorry to Gary!

